ARCHITECTURE (matches the established P4 seam pattern)
  • Shared-free surface (projection/format/export/model/strings/views/page/row/previews/registration);
    the SwiftUI views bind ONLY to TripListPageModel — no networking, no KMP symbols.
  • The ONE Shared-importing file (TripListPage.Live.swift) is #if canImport(Shared)-guarded and
    bridges the shared-core TripsStore.trips(params:) StateFlow<Resource<List<Trip>>> → TripListUpdate,
    mapping Trip → the Shared-free TripSummary (SI metres / watt-hours). Mirrors LiveDrivetrainHealthProvider.
  • SI stays on the wire; conversion happens only at the render boundary (TripListUnits, web pins) per S5.

